--- result.json ---
{
  "crash_cause": "UArenaScoreTracker* ScoreTracker in AArenaGameMode (Source/PixelArena/ArenaGameMode.h) was a raw UObject pointer without UPROPERTY(), so the garbage collector never saw a reference to the NewObject'd tracker and destroyed it (log: 'LogGarbage: Collecting garbage: 412 objects purged' at 21:05:13). The next goal (21:05:27) dereferenced the dangling pointer in AArenaGameMode::OnGoalScored -> UArenaScoreTracker::AddPoints (ArenaScoreTracker.cpp:18), causing EXCEPTION_ACCESS_VIOLATION. Fixed by adding UPROPERTY() (TObjectPtr) so the GC keeps the object alive.",
  "no_colors_cause": "The palette data asset /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary is loaded by a hardcoded string path via LoadObject in AArenaGameMode::BeginPlay, so the cook dependency scan never sees it, and Config/DefaultGame.ini only cooked /Game/Maps/Arena and /Game/Data/Effects (bCookAll=False). The package was therefore missing from the build: log shows 'Couldn't find file for package /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary' and 'Palette is null, using fallback gray'. Fixed by adding +DirectoriesToAlwaysCook=(Path=\"/Game/Data/Palettes\") to DefaultGame.ini."
}
